 = 4,55€, AMI 1 à 0% = 0€).\nConfirmez-vous cette cotation ?"}], "category": "cotation_ngap", "subcategory": "cotation_cumul|cotation_simple", "difficulty": "simple", "validated": false, "metadata": {}}
