MI 2 (18,20€) + MAU (9,15€) + IK 5km (3,10€), soit un total de 30,45€. C'est correct ?"}], "category": "cotation_ngap", "subcategory": "cotation_majoration", "difficulty": "moyen", "validated": false, "metadata": {}}
