}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Pour Mme Thomas, la cotation est :\n- AMI 4 (100%) : 36,40€\n- AMI 1 (50%) : 4,55€\n- IK 5km plaine : 3,10€\nSoit un total de 44,05€. Confirmez-vous la facturation ?"}], "category": "cotation_ngap", "subcategory": "cotation_cumul", "difficulty": "complexe", "validated": false, "metadata": {}}
